> Haven't tried it with named weapons and such -- in fact, I don't try it at
> all.  Out-and-out cheating.  Use at your own risk.  Your mileage may vary.

It appears to work quite well, and even confuses the "give same item
the same ID if possible" feature - all clones of item A, for example,
will be listed as item A if you pick up only one of them at a time.
